The analysis performed in this notebook examines the spatial and temporal distribution of chlorophyll-a data, and corresponding valid pixels, over a 21-year period (January 2003 - December 2023), which accounts for previous EQC information (

https://​cds​.climate​.copernicus​.eu​/datasets​/satellite​-ocean​-colour​?tab​=​quality​_assurance​_tab) and includes only complete years. The analysis is performed over three sectors within the oceanic region in the Southern Ocean located between latitudes 47.5°S and 63.5°S (i.e., the Permanent Open Ocean Zone, POOZ) 

